# The only image built from the repo root is the React web app:
#   docker build -f web/Dockerfile .      (also what CI runs, .github/workflows/aws.yml)
# It needs web/ and config/app.yaml; everything else stays out of the build context
# (and so out of the public image). Same list as web/Dockerfile.dockerignore, which
# BuildKit prefers; this copy covers builders that only read the root file.
*
!web
!config
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.env.*.local
